(*) Probe for ledger row 320, the reason the stored time is not exported.
(*) Reads Library/CompilerLibrary's top-level mutable variable from another
(*) component.  Compiles and runs only while that variable is declared in
(*) Library/CompilerLibrary.fsi as "var __globalTimeInformation: RR64".
component ReadStoredTime
export Executable
run():() = do
    recordTime(0)
    println("stored = " || __globalTimeInformation)
    println "PASS"
end
end
